&nbsp;

<p hash="2035061717" id="03545741Q-83f40508-70705df2a555"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>Gabarito:<span style="color:#e74c3c"> ERRADO.</span></strong></span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="277438621" id="03545741Q-3e28bdcf-9d35d227e433" style="margin-left:40px; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Por ser vedada a distin&ccedil;&atilde;o entre brasileiros natos e naturalizados, <span style="color:#e74c3c"><s>estes n&atilde;o est&atilde;o sujeitos a extradi&ccedil;&atilde;o.</s></span>&nbsp;<strong><span style="color:#e74c3c">ERRADO.</span></strong></span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="1662963460" id="03545741Q-951288ba-72520f342de0" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Uma norma infraconstitucional <strong>n&atilde;o pode estabelecer distin&ccedil;&otilde;es&nbsp;entre brasileiros natos e naturalizados,</strong> salvo os casos previstos na Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o, a qual faz uma reserva constitucional ao tema,&nbsp;vejamos:</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<blockquote>
<p hash="891097909" id="00389323Q-eefc4908-94369264907f"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>Art. 12.</strong></span></span></p>

<p hash="451181317" id="00389323Q-4daa82a3-7fb2df33995e" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">&sect; 2&ordm; A lei n&atilde;o poder&aacute; estabelecer distin&ccedil;&atilde;o entre brasileiros natos e naturalizados, salvo nos casos previstos nesta Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o.</span></span></p>
</blockquote>

&nbsp;

<p hash="200407854" id="03545741Q-d707c1ea-bed6c91bb970" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Dentre essas distin&ccedil;&otilde;es, a Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o autorizou a extradi&ccedil;&atilde;o apenas do brasileiro NATURALIZADO.</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="762652008" id="02765117Q-cf63bad0-8686e83ec236" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">O brasileiro nato, independentemente do crit&eacute;rio,&nbsp;<strong>n&atilde;o pode ser extraditado</strong>,&nbsp;conforme previs&atilde;o constante na Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o Federal,&nbsp;transcrita&nbsp;abaixo:</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<blockquote>
<p hash="1442928763" id="02427466Q-0c33b03f-155a479132ab" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>Art. 5&ordm;</strong>&nbsp;Todos s&atilde;o iguais perante a lei, sem distin&ccedil;&atilde;o de qualquer natureza, garantindo-se aos brasileiros e aos estrangeiros residentes no Pa&iacute;s a inviolabilidade do direito &agrave; vida, &agrave; liberdade, &agrave; igualdade, &agrave; seguran&ccedil;a e &agrave; propriedade, nos termos seguintes:</span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p hash="120281791" id="02427466Q-debdeebe-c726eff69241" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>LI - nenhum brasileiro ser&aacute; extraditado, salvo o naturalizado,&nbsp;</strong>em caso de crime comum, praticado antes da naturaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o, ou de comprovado envolvimento em tr&aacute;fico il&iacute;cito de entorpecentes e drogas afins, na forma da lei;</span></span></p>
</blockquote>

&nbsp;

<p hash="852399141" id="02765117Q-1ce2d429-3a39dbffcb49"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">E tamb&eacute;m&nbsp;na Lei de Migra&ccedil;&atilde;o (Lei n&ordm; 13.445/2017):</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<blockquote>
<p hash="1288413804" id="02427466Q-254af34f-e5cf5bb468e2"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Art. 82. N&atilde;o se conceder&aacute; a extradi&ccedil;&atilde;o quando:</span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p hash="2010592804" id="02427466Q-8c3dd4f0-23974babd742"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">I - o indiv&iacute;duo cuja extradi&ccedil;&atilde;o &eacute; solicitada ao Brasil for brasileiro nato;</span></span></p>
</blockquote>

&nbsp;

<p hash="1851380261" id="02575083Q-ef3ec6c9-17448100e698"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Mas quanto ao brasileiro naturalizado, &eacute; admitida sua extradi&ccedil;&atilde;o, conforme esquematizamos:</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="274669857" id="02575083Q-8c515114-dcff171ad1a8" style="margin-left:40px"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">1. Tiver cometido crime comum,&nbsp;<strong>ANTES&nbsp;</strong>da naturaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></span></p>

<p hash="1529739363" id="02575083Q-b0def6e7-72a54bed3552" style="margin-left:40px; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">2. Tiver cometido tr&aacute;fico il&iacute;cito de entorpecentes e drogas afins&nbsp;<strong>ANTES&nbsp;</strong>ou&nbsp;<strong>DEPOIS&nbsp;</strong>da naturaliza&ccedil;&atilde;o</span></span></p>

