comentario_professor.texto_html:
&nbsp;

<p hash="1250283998" id="03454663Q-e4fa6123-453c439841de" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>Gabarito: <span style="color:#3498db">CERTO.</span></strong></span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="374244695" id="03454663Q-d7dc83ae-ad47d05f8dfe" style="margin-left:40px; text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Constituem monop&oacute;lio da Uni&atilde;o a pesquisa e a lavra das jazidas de petr&oacute;leo e g&aacute;s natural.&nbsp;<strong><span style="color:#3498db">CERTO.</span></strong></span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<p hash="1086299450" id="03454663Q-330ab4d6-a34dd06f4eb8" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">O art. 177 disp&otilde;e sobre os monop&oacute;lio da Uni&atilde;o, dentre os quais&nbsp;a pesquisa e a lavra das jazidas de petr&oacute;leo e g&aacute;s natural.&nbsp;</span></span></p>

&nbsp;

<blockquote>
<p hash="1429935472" id="03454663Q-35326b55-a66e84ff646e" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">Art. 177. Constituem monop&oacute;lio da Uni&atilde;o:</span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p hash="794597279" id="03454663Q-74013562-bff70b8d70c3" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px"><strong>I - a pesquisa e a lavra das jazidas de petr&oacute;leo e g&aacute;s natural e outros hidrocarbonetos fluidos;&nbsp;</strong></span></span></p>

<p hash="1198563648" id="03454663Q-ecd4cda1-eb7f294c3fde" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">II - a refina&ccedil;&atilde;o do petr&oacute;leo nacional ou estrangeiro;</span></span></p>

<p hash="1182842663" id="03454663Q-e84b857b-023b3bf017c1" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">III - a importa&ccedil;&atilde;o e exporta&ccedil;&atilde;o dos produtos e derivados b&aacute;sicos resultantes das atividades previstas nos incisos anteriores;</span></span></p>

<p hash="1483117033" id="03454663Q-6af9ad9d-713ac6bc6e6c" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">IV - o transporte mar&iacute;timo do petr&oacute;leo bruto de origem nacional ou de derivados b&aacute;sicos de petr&oacute;leo produzidos no Pa&iacute;s, bem assim o transporte, por meio de conduto, de petr&oacute;leo bruto, seus derivados e g&aacute;s natural de qualquer origem;</span></span></p>

<p hash="1529782323" id="03454663Q-2ad403d8-d40b5f16f209" style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif"><span style="font-size:13px">V - a pesquisa, a lavra, o enriquecimento, o reprocessamento, a industrializa&ccedil;&atilde;o e o com&eacute;rcio de min&eacute;rios e minerais nucleares e seus derivados, com exce&ccedil;&atilde;o dos radiois&oacute;topos cuja produ&ccedil;&atilde;o, comercializa&ccedil;&atilde;o e utiliza&ccedil;&atilde;o poder&atilde;o ser autorizadas sob regime de permiss&atilde;o, conforme as al&iacute;neas b e c do inciso XXIII do caput do art. 21 desta Constitui&ccedil;&atilde;o Federal.&nbsp;</span></span></p>
</blockquote>

